    &lt;h1&gt;2026 Tesla Model Y Specs, Price &amp;amp; Trims&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-price"&gt;$39,990&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-chips"&gt;
      &lt;span&gt;Electric SUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Battery electric&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;RWD / Dual-motor AWD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;5 seats&lt;/span&gt;
