    &lt;p&gt;The 2026 Tesla Model Y is listed in the current U.S. lineup as a electric suv. Verified configurations include Battery electric. Available drivetrain information includes RWD / Dual-motor AWD. The lowest verified starting MSRP in the current source set is $39,990. This page consolidates the current manufacturer-sourced trim pricing and specification data available in the DriveSpecLab database without estimating unpublished prices.&lt;/p&gt;
