  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-table"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Model year&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Body style&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Electric SUV&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Drivetrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;RWD / Dual-motor AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Seating&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Starting MSRP&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;$39,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Current compact electric SUV&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Tesla Model Y exterior &amp; interior&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="dsl-seo-gallery"&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20front%20three-quarter%20exterior%20studio&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20side%20profile%20exterior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20rear%20three-quarter%20exterior%20rear%20view&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse4.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20dashboard%20cockpit%20infotainment%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20front%20seats%20cabin%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse3.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Model%20Y%20rear%20seats%20cabin%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Model Y interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Official verified specifications&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-table"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Body&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Electric midsize SUV&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Seats&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;5; Model Y L Premium has 6 seats&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Trims &amp; starting MSRP&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="dsl-seo-scroll"&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-trims"&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Trim / configuration&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Starting MSRP&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain / configuration&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rear-Wheel Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;$39,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • RWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Rear-Wheel Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Not published&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • RWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium All-Wheel Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Not published&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L Premium&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;$61,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Not published&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Tesla Design Studio currently shows Model Y Rear-Wheel Drive at $39,990 before Destination and Order Fees and a $41,630 current purchase price including those fees. Tesla&amp;#x27;s public page exposes current Premium and Performance specifications but did not expose an exact cash price for those configurations in the indexed official results used for this verification, so those rows intentionally carry no numeric price. Model Y L Premium is shown by Tesla at $61,990 before Destination and Order Fees ($63,630 including those fees).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Warranty&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;4 years/50,000 miles basic. Battery &amp;amp; Drive Unit warranty is generally 8 years with mileage limit varying by model/configuration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Source &amp; verification&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;DriveSpecLab uses current U.S. manufacturer material for this model. Unpublished prices are left unpublished rather than estimated.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Tesla Design Studio currently shows Model Y Rear-Wheel Drive at $39,990 before Destination and Order Fees and a $41,630 current purchase price including those fees. Tesla&amp;#x27;s public page exposes current Premium and Performance specifications but did not expose an exact cash price for those configurations in the indexed official results used for this verification, so those rows intentionally carry no numeric price. Model Y L Premium is shown by Tesla at $61,990 before Destination and Order Fees ($63,630 including those fees).&lt;/p&gt;
    
    &lt;a class="dsl-seo-source" href="https://www.tesla.com/modely" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;Official U.S. source ↗&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec dsl-seo-related"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;More Tesla models&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.drivespeclab.com/search/label/Tesla"&gt;View the full Tesla U.S. lineup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.drivespeclab.com/search/label/Tesla#usmodel=Model%203"&gt;Tesla Model 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.drivespeclab.com/search/label/Tesla#usmodel=Cybertruck"&gt;Tesla Cybertruck&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/article&gt;
