&lt;article class="dsl-seo-model-page" data-dsl-key="Tesla|Cybertruck" data-dsl-brand="Tesla" data-dsl-model="Cybertruck" data-dsl-year="2026"&gt;
  &lt;header class="dsl-seo-hero"&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-kicker"&gt;DriveSpecLab verified U.S. vehicle database&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;2026 Tesla Cybertruck Specs, Price &amp;amp; Trims&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-price"&gt;$74,990&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-chips"&gt;
      &lt;span&gt;Electric pickup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Battery electric&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;AWD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;5 seats&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The 2026 Tesla Cybertruck is listed in the current U.S. lineup as a electric pickup. Verified configurations include Battery electric. Available drivetrain information includes AWD. The lowest verified starting MSRP in the current source set is $74,990. This page consolidates the current manufacturer-sourced trim pricing and specification data available in the DriveSpecLab database without estimating unpublished prices.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;div class="dsl-seo-meta"&gt;Verified/compiled: 2026-09-14. MSRP excludes taxes, registration, dealer charges and destination unless the manufacturer source states otherwise.&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-table"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Model year&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;2026&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Body style&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Electric pickup&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Drivetrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Seating&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Starting MSRP&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;$74,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Stainless-steel electric pickup&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Tesla Cybertruck exterior &amp; interior&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="dsl-seo-gallery"&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20front%20three-quarter%20exterior%20studio&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20side%20profile%20exterior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20rear%20three-quarter%20exterior%20rear%20view&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck exterior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Exterior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse4.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20dashboard%20cockpit%20infotainment%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20front%20seats%20cabin%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://tse3.mm.bing.net/th?q=site%3Atesla.com%202026%20Tesla%20Cybertruck%20rear%20seats%20cabin%20interior&amp;amp;w=1200&amp;amp;h=760&amp;amp;c=7&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;p=0&amp;amp;o=5&amp;amp;dpr=1.25&amp;amp;pid=1.7&amp;amp;mkt=en-US&amp;amp;cc=US" alt="2026 Tesla Cybertruck interior view"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Interior&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Official verified specifications&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-table"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Body&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Electric pickup&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Drive&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Seats&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Towing Lbs Up To&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;11000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Trims &amp; starting MSRP&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="dsl-seo-scroll"&gt;&lt;table class="dsl-seo-trims"&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Trim / configuration&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Starting MSRP&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Powertrain / configuration&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dual Motor All-Wheel Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;$74,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium All-Wheel Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;$84,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cyberbeast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;$99,990&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Battery electric • AWD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Tesla Design Studio lists configuration prices before Destination and Order Fee. A currently selected Premium AWD example shows $87,235 including those fees; the grade-level cash prices below are Tesla&amp;#x27;s official configuration prices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Warranty&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;4 years/50,000 miles basic. Battery &amp;amp; Drive Unit warranty is generally 8 years with mileage limit varying by model/configuration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
  &lt;section class="dsl-seo-sec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Source &amp; verification&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;DriveSpecLab uses current U.S. manufacturer material for this model. Unpublished prices are left unpublished rather than estimated.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p class="dsl-seo-note"&gt;Tesla Design Studio lists configuration prices before Destination and Order Fee. A currently selected Premium AWD example shows $87,235 including those fees; the grade-level cash prices below are Tesla&amp;#x27;s official configuration prices.&lt;/p&gt;
    
